Position: Registered Nurse (Riverside Health Group)
Responsibilities:
1. Provide basic nursing care and observe patient conditions;
2. Complete nursing records and shift handovers;
3. Organize health education sessions;
4. Support ward supply management.
Requirements:
1. Nursing degree with valid license;
2. Patient and service minded;
3. Able to work rotating shifts;
4. Internship experience preferred.

